2026-04-11 20:58:41 INFO: {'model': {'messages': [AIMessage(content='Here is the story:\n\nThe Little Rabbit and the Lonely Fox\n\nOnce upon a time, in a sunny meadow, there lived a little rabbit named Rosie. She loved to play with her friends, chasing butterflies and sniffing wildflowers.\n\nOne day, while out on an adventure, Rosie met a lonely fox named Felix. He was sitting by himself, looking sad and lost. Rosie\'s heart went out to him, and she decided to introduce herself.\n\n"Hello there, my name is Rosie," she said with a friendly smile. "What\'s yours?"\n\nFelix looked up at her with big, sad eyes. "I\'m Felix," he replied in a low voice. "I don\'t have any friends here."\n\nRosie\'s ears perked up. She loved making new friends! "Well, I\'d love to be your friend!" she exclaimed.\n\nFelix\'s face lit up, and he smiled for the first time that day. "Really? You want to be my friend?"\n\nRosie nodded enthusiastically. "Of course! We can play together, explore the meadow, and have all sorts of fun!"\n\nFrom that day on, Rosie and Felix became inseparable friends. They went on adventures, shared secrets, and supported each other through thick and thin.\n\nAs they played together, Rosie realized that even small acts of kindness could make a big difference in someone\'s life. By being there for Felix when he needed her most, she had helped him feel less lonely and more confident.\n\nOne day, as they sat together under a shady tree, Felix turned to Rosie with tears in his eyes. "Thank you for being my friend," he said, his voice trembling. "You\'ve made me feel seen and heard in a way I never have before."\n\nRosie\'s heart swelled with happiness. She knew that she had found a true friend in Felix, and that their friendship would last a lifetime.\n\nAs the sun began to set, Rosie and Felix hugged each other tightly. "I\'m so glad we met," Rosie said, smiling up at her friend.\n\nFelix smiled back, his eyes shining with gratitude. "Me too, Rosie. Me too."', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model': 'llama3.1', 'created_at': '2026-04-11T18:58:41.7172444Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 73100001100, 'load_duration': 187092200, 'prompt_eval_count': 2814, 'prompt_eval_duration': 786973600, 'eval_count': 438, 'eval_duration': 71110772000, 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'llama3.1', 'model_provider': 'ollama'}, id='lc_run--019d7de7-fc2b-7be3-8b0e-86c4d9b2fd03-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2814, 'output_tokens': 438, 'total_tokens': 3252})]}}
